post.description:
Proxy an arbitrary HTTP request to an agent's memory provider.

Request envelope:
    {"payload": {"http-request-type": "POST", "http-url": "/v1/memories",
                 "http-request-body": {...}, "http-headers": {...}}}

Response envelope:
    {"http-status": 200, "http-headers": {...}, "http-response-body": {...}}
